From: Buon-Omba <302052335+Buon-Omba@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: gs101-bluejay: declare handset chassis

Luma (and other mobile distributions) start their phone shell when the
device tree says the board is a handset.

Signed-off-by: Buon-Omba <302052335+Buon-Omba@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-bluejay.dts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-bluejay.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-bluejay.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-bluejay.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-bluejay.dts
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@
 / {
 	model = "Bluejay";
 	compatible = "google,gs101-bluejay", "google,gs101";
+	chassis-type = "handset";
 };
 
 &cont_splash_mem {
